<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: An unusual drought has set in.

Drought is devastating for plant life and will quickly destroy all the crops not planted in the hydroponics. Be sure to quickly harvest any plants you can.-->
  <Drought.description>一场不寻常的干旱已经到来。

干旱对植物生命具有毁灭性，并将迅速摧毁所有未种植在水培中的农作物。一定要尽快收割尽可能多的植物。</Drought.description>
  <!--EN: The drought is ending.-->
  <Drought.endMessage>干旱即将结束。</Drought.endMessage>
  <!--EN: Drought-->
  <Drought.label>干旱</Drought.label>
  <!--EN: An unusual drought has set in.\n\nDrought is devastating for plant life and will quickly prevent all the crops not planted in hydroponics or high fertility soil to grow.-->
  <Drought.letterText>一场不寻常的干旱已经到来。

干旱对植物生命具有毁灭性，将很快阻止所有未种植在水培或高肥力土壤中的作物生长。</Drought.letterText>
  <!--EN: Global temperatures have suddenly risen to dangerous levels.

Flora and Fauna is suffering from these changes as biomes shift into their warmer counterparts. Resources become scarce, forcing factions into conflict.

It will last anywhere between a season to several years.-->
  <GlobalWarming.description>全球气温突然上升到危险水平。

随着生物群落向更温暖的区域转变，动植物群正在遭受这些变化。资源变得稀缺，迫使派系陷入冲突。

它将持续一个季节到几年。</GlobalWarming.description>
  <!--EN: The global warming is ending-->
  <GlobalWarming.endMessage>全球变暖正在结束</GlobalWarming.endMessage>
  <!--EN: Global Warming-->
  <GlobalWarming.label>全球暖化</GlobalWarming.label>
  <!--EN: A freak, small scale hail storm is ravaging the local area. Any person or creature not hiding under the roof risks getting injured by ice pellets.-->
  <HailStorm.description>一场反常的小规模冰雹风暴正在肆虐当地。任何不躲在屋顶下的人或生物都有被冰粒伤害的风险。</HailStorm.description>
  <!--EN: The hail storm is ending.-->
  <HailStorm.endMessage>冰雹风暴即将结束。</HailStorm.endMessage>
  <!--EN: Hail Storm-->
  <HailStorm.label>冰雹风暴</HailStorm.label>
  <!--EN: A freak, small scale hail storm is ravaging the local area. Any person or creature not hiding under the roof risks getting injured by ice pellets.-->
  <HailStorm.letterText>一场反常的小规模冰雹风暴正在肆虐当地。任何不躲在屋顶下的人或生物都有被冰粒伤害的风险。</HailStorm.letterText>
  <!--EN: Atmospheric composition of the planet drastically changed resulting in a significant drop in temperature.

Flora and Fauna is suffering from these changes as biomes shift into their colder counterparts. Resources become scarce, forcing factions into conflict.

It will last anywhere between a season to several years.-->
  <IceAge.description>地球的大气成分发生了巨大变化，导致温度显着下降。

随着生物群系转变为较冷的对应区域，动植物群正在遭受这些变化。资源变得稀缺，迫使派系陷入冲突。

它将持续一个季节到几年。</IceAge.description>
  <!--EN: The ice age is ending-->
  <IceAge.endMessage>冰河时代即将结束</IceAge.endMessage>
  <!--EN: Ice Age-->
  <IceAge.label>冰期</IceAge.label>
  <!--EN: A space entity of unimaginable size has covered a local star, resulting in a long lasting eclipse.

Terrified of this supernatural phenomenon, other factions will use this time to wage war and conflict across the surface.

It will last anywhere between a season to several years.-->
  <LongNight.description>一个难以想象的大小的太空实体覆盖了一颗当地恒星，导致了一场持久的日食。

由于对这种超自然现象感到恐惧，其他派系将利用这段时间在整个地表发动战争和冲突。

它将持续一个季节到几年不等。</LongNight.description>
  <!--EN: The long night is ending-->
  <LongNight.endMessage>漫漫长夜即将结束</LongNight.endMessage>
  <!--EN: Long Night-->
  <LongNight.label>长夜</LongNight.label>
  <!--EN: A strong psychic pulse emitted by a long forgotten entity changed the very genetical structure of local flora. Whilst the sky filled with a seemingly endless auroras, colourful flowers started sprouting everywhere. 

All pawns will gain a positive mood buff for the time of the event. The rapidly spreading flowers will overgrow everything, including your fields. 

It will last anywhere between a few days to a season.-->
  <PsychicBloom.description>一个早已被遗忘的实体发出的强烈心灵脉冲改变了当地植物群的基因结构。当天空布满了看似无尽的极光时，五颜六色的花朵开始随处绽放。 

所有 pawn 将在活动期间获得积极情绪增益。迅速蔓延的花朵将覆盖一切，包括你的田地。 

它将持续几天到一个季节。</PsychicBloom.description>
  <!--EN: The psychic bloom is ending-->
  <PsychicBloom.endMessage>心灵之花即将结束</PsychicBloom.endMessage>
  <!--EN: Psychic Bloom-->
  <PsychicBloom.label>心灵绽放</PsychicBloom.label>
  <!--EN: A dangerous psychic entity caused disturbance on subatomic levels, resonating across all particles of the atmosphere.

A seemingly endless supernatural rain has begun, altering the very composition of time. Any person or creature not under the roof will age significantly faster.

It will last anywhere between a season to several years.-->
  <PsychicRain.description>一个危险的灵能实体在亚原子水平上引起了干扰，在大气中的所有粒子上产生了共鸣。

一场看似无尽的超自然雨已经开始，改变了时间的构成。不在屋檐下的任何人或生物都会明显加速衰老。

它将持续一个季节到几年。</PsychicRain.description>
  <!--EN: The psychic rain is ending-->
  <PsychicRain.endMessage>心灵之雨即将结束</PsychicRain.endMessage>
  <!--EN: Psychic Rain-->
  <PsychicRain.label>心灵之雨</PsychicRain.label>
  <!--EN: A space battle is raging in the sky, may last up to 1 day.-->
  <SpaceBattle.description>一场太空战斗正在天空中激烈进行，可能会持续长达1天。</SpaceBattle.description>
  <!--EN: The space battle is ending.-->
  <SpaceBattle.endMessage>太空之战即将结束。</SpaceBattle.endMessage>
  <!--EN: Space battle-->
  <SpaceBattle.label>太空战</SpaceBattle.label>
  <!--EN: Several massive spaceships have engaged in combat in the planet’s orbit. Missed shots and debris can impact the ground in the area. This can lead to massive fires.-->
  <SpaceBattle.letterText>几艘大型宇宙飞船已经在地球轨道上进行了战斗。错过的射击和碎片可能会影响该地区的地面。这可能会导致大规模火灾。</SpaceBattle.letterText>
</LanguageData>
